[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11220.87, "timestamp": "03:07:00", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11223.75, "timestamp": "03:07:03", "text": "我以前也这么做过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11226.23, "timestamp": "03:07:06", "text": "现在我直接上传就行了，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11229.75, "timestamp": "03:07:09", "text": "现在直播平台太多了。 以前我都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11232.23, "timestamp": "03:07:12", "text": "像拍电影一样做视频，就像电影里那样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11237.67, "timestamp": "03:07:17", "text": "视频里会有隐藏字幕，字幕直接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11240.87, "timestamp": "03:07:20", "text": "显示在视频里，而不是像以前那样放在视频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11245.03, "timestamp": "03:07:25", "text": "外面。是的，我以前就是这么做的，这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11251.349, "timestamp": "03:07:31", "text": "很占用电脑资源。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11254.389, "timestamp": "03:07:34", "text": "现在我24小时都在做这件事，我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11256.63, "timestamp": "03:07:36", "text": "在YouTube上，只要我在线就会直播，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11260.15, "timestamp": "03:07:40", "text": "但我仍然在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11262.95, "timestamp": "03:07:42", "text": "Twitch和Kick上保持直播，因为我想通过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.11, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "不断直播来发展Twitch和Kick，即使是V"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11271.67, "timestamp": "03:07:51", "text": "Relay直播，这样人们至少还能看到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11274.55, "timestamp": "03:07:54", "text": "一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11278.95, "timestamp": "03:07:58", "text": "我不知道。 是的。 嗯，"}]